RESULT
  A directed-broadcast packet with destination MAC = FFFF.FFFF.FFFF is forwarded onto the
  target subnet IDENTICALLY to one addressed to the ingress interface MAC.
      interface-MAC (gateway) : 5/5 delivered to subnet B
      all-FF broadcast MAC    : 5/5 delivered to subnet B      => IDENTICAL. PASS.

