### VERDICT interface-MAC=5 all-FF=5 -> IDENTICAL (PASS) ###
  => In both cases the DUT converted the packet destined to 10.10.20.31 into an L2 broadcast
     on subnet B (vlan20) and delivered all 5 to the subnet-B receiver. The destination MAC
     being all-FF vs the interface MAC made no difference, exactly as the objective states.
